{"unit_id":"7gzgn__dsh-douyin-publish#card-1","repo":"7gzgn/dsh-douyin-publish","commit":"9b6e85527b8e5f1a2ff6c5ff008facdf87d40238","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-douyin-publish 是面向 DSH 浏览器工具的本地视频投稿助手，支持抖音和 B 站。它注册 douyin_upload 工具，打开投稿页并检查页面控件，将本地视频交给网页上传控件，填写标题、简介和话题，设置可见性及抖音封面时间。可选本地混音或打开平台配乐面板。默认设为仅自己可见并停在发布前；用户显式选择发布模式后才提交。适合需要整理视频投稿信息并通过浏览器完成上传的创作者。需要已登录的创作者账号和 DSH browser 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:77","lib/pipeline.js:2"]}
{"unit_id":"7gzgn__dsh-douyin-publish#card-2","repo":"7gzgn/dsh-douyin-publish","commit":"9b6e85527b8e5f1a2ff6c5ff008facdf87d40238","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-douyin-publish prepares local videos for Douyin or Bilibili through DSH browser tools. It opens the creator upload page, attaches video, and fills post details and visibility. Optional soundtrack mixing and cover selection are available. It defaults to private draft and stops before publishing.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:77","lib/pipeline.js:2"]}
