{"unit_id":"7gzgn__dsh-douyin-publish#feature-1","repo":"7gzgn/dsh-douyin-publish","commit":"9b6e85527b8e5f1a2ff6c5ff008facdf87d40238","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-douyin-publish 的功能「视频投稿准备」：将本地视频上传到抖音或 B 站创作者投稿页，填写标题、简介和话题，并设置可见性；默认停在发布前。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/pipeline.js:2","lib/index.js:123"]}
{"unit_id":"7gzgn__dsh-douyin-publish#feature-2","repo":"7gzgn/dsh-douyin-publish","commit":"9b6e85527b8e5f1a2ff6c5ff008facdf87d40238","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-douyin-publish 的功能「本地配乐」：提供本地音频时先与视频混音再上传，也可打开抖音平台配乐面板供用户选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:83","lib/pipeline.js:18"]}
{"unit_id":"7gzgn__dsh-douyin-publish#feature-3","repo":"7gzgn/dsh-douyin-publish","commit":"9b6e85527b8e5f1a2ff6c5ff008facdf87d40238","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-douyin-publish 的功能「投稿参数检查」：可先用 dryRun 检查视频和投稿计划，不打开页面或上传文件；执行时会核对页面控件和关键填写结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:88","lib/pipeline.js:2"]}
{"unit_id":"7gzgn__dsh-douyin-publish#feature-4","repo":"7gzgn/dsh-douyin-publish","commit":"9b6e85527b8e5f1a2ff6c5ff008facdf87d40238","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-douyin-publish 的功能「封面帧设置」：可为抖音指定视频中的秒数作为封面画帧，默认取第 1 秒，也可设为 0 保留现有封面。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:101","lib/plan.js:24"]}
{"unit_id":"7gzgn__dsh-douyin-publish#caveat-1","repo":"7gzgn/dsh-douyin-publish","commit":"9b6e85527b8e5f1a2ff6c5ff008facdf87d40238","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-douyin-publish 使用前须知：上传内容会提交到所选平台的创作者投稿页；默认仅自己可见且不会点击发布，显式选择 publish 才会提交。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/plan.js:5","lib/pipeline.js:2"]}
